{"id": "10", "html": "<p>Welcome to &#8220;Example Blog&#8221; &#8212; a place for notes&#8230; It&#8217;s simple.</p>\n[caption id=\"attachment_30\" align=\"alignright\" width=\"300\"]<a href=\"https://blog.example.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/big-chart.png\"><img class=\"size-medium wp-image-30\" src=\"https://blog.example.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/big-chart-30x17.png\" alt=\"Bar chart\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" /></a> Monthly <em>numbers</em>[/caption]\n<p>Read the <a href=\"https://blog.example.com/?p=12\">café piece</a> and the <a href=\"http://old.example.com/company/history/\">history page</a>.<br />\n<!--more--><br />\nHere is the original via Jetpack: <img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/blog.example.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/big-chart.png?resize=64%2C36&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p>See <a href=\"https://blog.example.com/?attachment_id=30\">the chart page</a>.</p>\n"}
{"id": "11", "html": "[gallery columns=\"2\" link=\"file\"]\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Value</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Apples</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li>First</li>\n<li>Second\n<ol>\n<li>Nested</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-go\">fmt.Println(\"hi\")</pre>\n[youtube https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ]\n<p>https://vimeo.com/76979871</p>\n<p>Bare line done.</p>\n"}
{"id": "12", "html": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A &#8220;café&#8221; story in blocks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"the-menu\">The menu</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":30,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.example.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/big-chart-scaled.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-30\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Prices this year</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"note\">Opening hours vary.</div><script>console.log(\"x\")</script>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:acme/opening-hours {\"days\":5} /-->\n"}
{"id": "13", "html": "<p>Page one text.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"callout\">A boxed note with <span style=\"color: #cc0000\">red text</span>.</div>\n[pullquote]Good writing is rewriting[/pullquote]\n<p>We say [sic] here, and cite [1].<br />\n<!--nextpage--><br />\nPage two has an external image: <img src=\"https://cdn.other.example.org/pic.png\" alt=\"External\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" /></p>\n<p>And a missing one: <img src=\"https://blog.example.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/gone.png\" alt=\"Gone\" /><br />\n<!--nextpage--><br />\n<iframe src=\"https://forms.example.org/embed/1\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\"></iframe></p>\n<p>Page three ends here.</p>\n"}
